{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aSUTVqsV1Z1795742371.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>多個宗教團體亦有相關追悼儀式。</p><p></p><p>其中香港道教聯合會，在粉嶺蓬瀛仙館設立宏福苑火災周年祈福追思道場，開放予公眾致祭，希望藉設立追思道場，超度亡靈，撫慰受火災影響市民的心靈。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.MEMORIAL-2200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qX75MULBeJ1795712139.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天主教香港教區就連續第二天舉行宏福苑追思彌撒，其中在筲箕灣聖十字架堂，吸引不少信眾及市民參加，為災民祈禱。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.MEMORIAL-2200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MgVubFdYSd1795712095.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:03:53.352502+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:13.226858+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:19.537295+00:00","content_hash":"0c9ad511bcdf772a0813551e415143b7d230caf5b7b9b4d48861e0831656210a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:03:53.352502+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}